    "innovation": "This paper demonstrates, using single-forcing climate simulations, that anthropogenic aerosols have masked a greenhouse gas-induced decrease in summer rainfall over north-western Australia, explaining why recent observed trends differ from future projections under greenhouse gas forcing.",
