            "paragraph": "The CSIRO Mark 3.6 (CSIRO-Mk3.6) GCM was developed from the earlier Mk3.5 version, which was described in detail by Gordon et al. (2002, 2010). It is a coupled atmosphere-ocean model with dynamic sea ice. It also has a soil-canopy scheme with prescribed vegetation properties. The ocean, sea-ice and soil-canopy models are unchanged between Mk3.5 and Mk3.6.",
