            "target_entity_type": "SourceComponent",
            "paragraph": "The main differences between Mk3.5 and Mk3.6 are the inclusion of an interactive aerosol treatment and an updated radiation scheme in Mk3.6. The aerosol scheme treats sulfate, carbonaceous aerosol, mineral dust and sea salt.",
