            "target_entity_type": "Metric",
            "paragraph": "Using the method from Cai et al. (2011), Mk3.6 has an IOD amplitude of 0.40\u25e6C, more than twice the observed value. These results provide some insight into why our model simulates a relatively strong drying trend over Australia in RCP4.5.",
